{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02348","headline":"杂歌谣辞 郑樱桃歌 · 李颀","name":"杂歌谣辞 郑樱桃歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石季龙，僭天禄。\n擅雄豪，美人姓郑名樱桃。\n樱桃美颜香且泽，娥娥侍寝专宫掖。\n後庭卷衣三万人，翠眉清镜不得亲。\n官军女骑一千匹，繁花照耀漳河春。\n织成花映红纶巾，红旗掣曳卤簿新。\n鸣鼙走马接飞鸟，铜[驮]琴瑟随去尘。\n凤阳重门如意馆，百尺金梯倚银汉。\n自言富贵不可量，女爲公主男爲王。\n赤花双簟珊瑚牀，盘龙斗帐琥珀光。\n淫昏僞位神所恶，灭石者陵终不误。\n邺城苍苍白露微，世事飜覆黄云飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}